 dia pergi", "ur": "پس وہ جاتا ہے", "bn": "অতএব সে যায়", "fa": "پس می‌رود"}}, {"arabic": "لَنَذْهَبَنَّ", "count": 1, "first": "17:86", "audio": "audio/aac54531aa9bafa64384.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "surely we will take away", "bs": "zaista ćemo odnijeti", "tr": "kesinlikle götüreceğiz", "fr": "nous emporterons assurément", "id": "sungguh kami akan membawa pergi", "ur": "یقیناً ہم لے جائیں گے", "bn": "নিশ্চয়ই আমরা নিয়ে যাব", "fa": "قطعاً خواهیم برد"}}, {"arabic": "وَيَذْهَبَا", "count": 1, "first": "20:63", "audio": "audio/c95b4356598f33582a77.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huma", "passive": false, "objects": ["huma"], "mood": "subjunctive"}], "gloss": {"en": "and they (two) take away", "bs": "i odnose", "tr": "ve götürürler", "fr": "et ils (deux) emportent", "id": "dan mereka berdua membawa pergi", "ur": "اور وہ دونوں لے جاتے ہیں", "bn": "এবং তারা দুজন নিয়ে যায়", "fa": "و آن دو می‌برند"}}, {"arabic": "ذَّهَبَ", "count": 1, "first": "21:87", "audio": "audio/b82273038dbc9cf178bd.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it went", "bs": "otišao je", "tr": "gitti", "fr": "il est allé", "id": "dia telah pergi", "ur": "وہ گیا", "bn": "সে গেল", "fa": "رفت"}}, {"arabic": "لَّذَهَبَ", "count": 1, "first": "23:91", "audio": "audio/cd6e35737bde7e8f5ef5.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}]}, {"arabic": "يَذْهَبُ", "count": 1, "first": "24:43", "audio": "audio/6c87b0a6e8786dc2dbb2.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it takes away", "bs": "odnosi", "tr": "götürür", "fr": "il emporte", "id": "dia membawa pergi", "ur": "وہ لے جاتا ہے", "bn": "সে নিয়ে যায়", "fa": "می‌برد"}}, {"arabic": "فَٱذْهَبَا", "count": 1, "first": "26:15", "audio"